  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "As per gauss theorem,\n$\\begin{aligned}& \\phi=\\frac{\\mathrm{q}_{\\text {in }}}{\\epsilon_0}=\\frac{\\mathrm{q}+(-2 \\mathrm{q})+5 \\mathrm{q}}{\\epsilon_0} \\\\\n& \\frac{4 \\mathrm{q}}{\\epsilon_0}\\end{aligned}$",
